   "widgets_values": [
    "01 ANIME CADENCE ON ANY CLIP\n\nPoint 'Load Video (Path)' at a finished H3 render. Anime Cadence re-times it onto 2s/3s (mode auto follows the timing H3 already chose; pick sharpest keeps the crispest frame of each hold). The two Measure nodes print the cadence before/after.\n\nmode: auto | twos | threes | fours | adaptive (fast->2s, slow->3s/4s)\npick: sharpest | first (keeps 1-frame impact flashes) | middle\nmin_hold/max_hold/sensitivity: adaptive only. offset: fixed modes only."
